   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Before something else",
     "texto": [
      "For an action earlier than another in the past, use **havde** + participle: **havde spist** = had eaten.",
      "Example: **Da jeg kom, havde han spist.** = When I arrived, he had already eaten."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Have or være",
     "texto": [
      "Most verbs form the earlier past with **havde**. Many intransitive verbs that express arrival or a change of state use **var**: **Da jeg kom, var han gået hjem.** = When I arrived, he had gone home.",
      "Movement alone is not enough: **Hun har gået rundt hele dagen** = She has been walking around all day. The auxiliary can depend on the meaning; learn the common examples in context."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
